(*---
description: 'A tautologous temporal formula gives a checker-free run: no tautology error in simulation mode.'
ref: tlc2/tool/liveness/LiveCheck1.java#checkTrace
features: [liveness]
outcome: success
config: |
  SPECIFICATION Spec
  PROPERTY Prop
  CHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE
args:
  - -simulate
  - num=8
  - -depth
  - 6
---*)
---- MODULE simulate_tautology_not_rejected ----
EXTENDS Naturals
VARIABLE x
Next == x < 2 /\ x' = x + 1
Spec == x = 0 /\ [][Next]_x /\ WF_x(Next)
Prop == <>[]TRUE => TRUE
====

